==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|ḱens}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*kensēō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro||*ḱn̥s-é-ti}}, {{m|ine-pro||*ḱn̥s-eyé-ti}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ḱens-||to announce}}. Cognate with {{cog|sa|शंसति|tr=śáṃsati||to declare}}, {{cog|ira-pro|*cánhati}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|cēnseō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|2.p3inf|cēnseō|cēnsu|cēns}}

# I give an [[opinion]].
# I [[think]], [[suppose]] or [[judge]].
# I [[recommend]].
#: ''Ceterum '''censeo''' Carthaginem esse delendam''
# I [[decree]], [[vote]] or [[determine]].
# I [[count]] or [[reckon]].
# I [[assess]].

